      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card-bg: #16213e;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --green: #4caf50;\n  --red: #f44336;\n  --yellow: #ffeb3b;\n  --blue: #2196f3;\n  --pad-dim: 0.5;\n  --pad-bright: 1;\n  --focus-ring: #ffffff;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.game-container {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 480px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.status-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 2rem;\n}\n\n.level {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.message {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  color: #ff6b6b;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.board {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 12px;\n  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;\n}\n\n.pad {\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  opacity: var(--pad-dim);\n  transition: opacity 0.1s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.1s;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.pad.green { background: var(--green); }\n.pad.red { background: var(--red); }\n.pad.yellow { background: var(--yellow); }\n.pad.blue { background: var(--blue); }\n\n.pad:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  opacity: 0.8;\n}\n\n.pad:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.pad.active {\n  opacity: var(--pad-bright);\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 16px currentColor;\n}\n\n.pad:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n}\n\n.pad:disabled {\n  cursor: default;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 48px;\n}\n\n.restart-btn {\n  background: var(--text);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 12px 32px;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n}\n\n.restart-btn:hover {\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.restart-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus-ring);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.restart-btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .board {\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "CSS styles"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const pads = document.querySelectorAll('.pad');\nconst levelDisplay = document.getElementById('level-display');\nconst messageEl = document.getElementById('message');\nconst restartBtn = document.getElementById('restart-btn');\n\nlet sequence = [];\nlet playerIndex = 0;\nlet level = 0;\nlet acceptingInput = false;\nlet gameOver = false;\nlet playbackTimeout = null;\n\nconst colors = ['green', 'red', 'yellow', 'blue'];\n\nfunction updateLevelDisplay() {\n  levelDisplay.textContent = `Level: ${level}`;\n}\n\nfunction showMessage(text) {\n  messageEl.textContent = text;\n}\n\nfunction clearMessage() {\n  messageEl.textContent = '';\n}\n\nfunction setPadsDisabled(disabled) {\n  pads.forEach(pad => {\n    pad.disabled = disabled;\n    pad.setAttribute('aria-disabled', disabled);\n  });\n}\n\nfunction playSequence() {\n  acceptingInput = false;\n  setPadsDisabled(true);\n  let i = 0;\n  function next() {\n    if (i >= sequence.length) {\n      acceptingInput = true;\n      setPadsDisabled(false);\n      playerIndex = 0;\n      return;\n    }\n    const color = sequence[i];\n    const pad = document.querySelector(`.pad[data-color=\"${color}\"]`);\n    pad.classList.add('active');\n    playbackTimeout = setTimeout(() => {\n      pad.classList.remove('active');\n      playbackTimeout = setTimeout(() => {\n        i++;\n        next();\n      }, 200);\n    }, 400);\n  }\n  next();\n}\n\nfunction nextRound() {\n  if (gameOver) return;\n  level++;\n  updateLevelDisplay();\n  clearMessage();\n  const randomColor = colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * colors.length)];\n  sequence.push(randomColor);\n  playSequence();\n}\n\nfunction handlePadClick(e) {\n  if (!acceptingInput || gameOver) return;\n  const pad = e.currentTarget;\n  const color = pad.dataset.color;\n  pad.classList.add('active');\n  setTimeout(() => pad.classList.remove('active'), 200);\n\n  if (color === sequence[playerIndex]) {\n    playerIndex++;\n    if (playerIndex === sequence.length) {\n      acceptingInput = false;\n      setPadsDisabled(true);\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        if (!gameOver) nextRound();\n      }, 600);\n    }\n  } else {\n    gameOver = true;\n    acceptingInput = false;\n    setPadsDisabled(true);\n    showMessage('Game over!');\n    restartBtn.hidden = false;\n    restartBtn.focus();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction restartGame() {\n  clearTimeout(playbackTimeout);\n  sequence = [];\n  playerIndex = 0;\n  level = 0;\n  gameOver = false;\n  acceptingInput = false;\n  restartBtn.hidden = true;\n  clearMessage();\n  setPadsDisabled(true);\n  updateLevelDisplay();\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    nextRound();\n  }, 500);\n}\n\npads.forEach(pad => {\n  pad.addEventListener('click', handlePadClick);\n});\n\nrestartBtn.addEventListener('click', restartGame);\n\nrestartGame();",
      "description": "Game logic"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Simon Game\n\nA classic Simon memory game with a pixel-art inspired design. Watch the sequence of colored pads light up, then repeat it by clicking the pads. Each round adds one more step. A wrong click ends the game.\n\n## How to Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or internet connection required.\n\n## Game Rules\n\n1. The game starts automatically at Level 1.\n2. Watch the sequence of flashing pads.\n3. Click the pads in the same order.\n4. Each successful round increases the level and adds one more step.\n5. Clicking the wrong pad shows \"Game over!\" and a Restart button.\n\n## Features\n\n- Four colored pads (green, red, yellow, blue) with hover, focus, and active states.\n- Level display and status messages.\n- Keyboard accessible: all pads and the Restart button are focusable and labeled.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px width.\n- Offline, no dependencies, plain HTML/CSS/JavaScript.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure\n- `styles.css` – styling\n- `script.js` – game logic\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation"
    }
  ]
